prompt_template:
You are a TikTok-style video cover designer. Create one square video-cover image for this product.

Style:
- 1:1 square frame
- strong commercial energy, high saturation, high contrast, bold visual impact
- the product takes a large share of the frame (the cover must instantly show the merchandise)
- build a "cover" feel through visual symbols (light burst / strong contrast / pop accents) rather than text

Hard rule:
- DO NOT render any text, letters, numbers, characters, words, titles, labels, price tags, packaging copy, watermarks, signs, or logos anywhere in the image. Image-generation models cannot render Chinese characters reliably, so avoid all in-image text.

Product:
- Name: {{name_en}}
- Category: {{category_en}}
- Price: {{price_en}}
- Core features: {{features_en}}
- Target user: {{target_user_en}}

Return the image directly.
